# Playlists — /api/playlists/

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "twist_demo",
  "password": "Tw1st!Senha#Forte"
}

###
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.access}}

### Criar playlist (para enviar capa, use multipart/form-data com o campo "cover")
# @name createPlaylist
POST {{baseUrl}}/playlists/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ficção científica",
  "description": "Os melhores do gênero",
  "is_public": true
}

###
@playlistId = {{createPlaylist.response.body.id}}

### Minhas playlists
GET {{baseUrl}}/playlists/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Adicionar filme (tmdb_id do TMDB; 603 = Matrix)
POST {{baseUrl}}/playlists/{{playlistId}}/movies/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tmdb_id": 603
}

### Adicionar outro filme (157336 = Interestelar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/playlists/{{playlistId}}/movies/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tmdb_id": 157336
}

### Detalhes da playlist com os filmes (pública: qualquer um vê; privada: só o dono)
GET {{baseUrl}}/playlists/{{playlistId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Editar playlist (só o dono)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/playlists/{{playlistId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sci-fi favoritos",
  "is_public": false
}

### Remover filme da playlist
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/playlists/{{playlistId}}/movies/157336/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Excluir playlist (só o dono)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/playlists/{{playlistId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
